            <ArticleTitle>Traumatic coronary artery fistula closure with stent graft.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>59-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a rare case of a symptomatic acquired large coronary fistula and aneurysm secondary to chest trauma that was successfully closed using stent graft. This case is followed by review of the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
